  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  DialogueText: 'Oh no! I''m sorry buddy!<n>

    You managed to find a piece, but
    it looks too small to properly fill any square!<n>

    Maybe if this piece believed
    in itself more it could fan those big ears out and be useful.<n>

    But as
    it is now, it''ll only get in the way of your other pieces. :c'
